title    Arcade palette: melodic
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Each new melodic instrument alone for two bars, in its useful range: fmbass, supersaw, distguitar, orchhit, synbrass, riser, downlifter.
tempo    140
beats    4
steps    2
reverb   0.2

voice fmbass     fmbass     vol=0.8
voice supersaw   supersaw   vol=0.75
voice distguitar distguitar vol=0.7
voice orchhit    orchhit    vol=0.7
voice synbrass   synbrass   vol=0.7
voice riser      riser      vol=0.7
voice downlifter downlifter vol=0.7

pattern fm
fmbass | E2 E2 E3 E2 G2 A2 B2 D3 | E2- ~G2- A2- . . |

pattern saw
supersaw | E5- G5- B5--- | A5- G5 F#5 E5--- |

pattern gtr
distguitar | E3+B3+E4--- . . G3+D4- | E2+B2 E2+B2 E2+B2 . G2+D3-- . |

pattern orch
orchhit | E4+G4+B4 . . E4+G4+B4 .--- | C4+E4+G4 . D4+F#4+A4 . E4+G4+B4--- |

pattern brass
synbrass | B4--- . A4 B4 D5 | E5------ . |

pattern rise
riser | C6------- | = |

pattern fall
downlifter | C6------- | = |

pattern rest
fmbass | _ |

play fm saw gtr orch brass rise fall
loop rest
